A [[human]] [[Gender|male]] [[bounty hunter]] operated as a member of the [[Bounty Hunters' Guild]] during the [[New Republic Era|era]] of the [[New Republic]].<ref name="Chapter 7" /> Around [[9 ABY]],<ref name="Date" /> the hunter was recruited by [[Greef Karga]] to steal a [[force-sensitive]] [[Din Grogu|child]] from [[Mandalorian]] [[bounty]] hunter [[Din Djarin]]. The human hunter and a [[Nikto]] [[Unidentified Nikto bounty hunter|bounty hunter]] attempted to [[Death|kill]] Djarin, but they were both betrayed and killed by Karga, who found himself unable to go through with the plan after a [[Nevarro reptavian|native reptavian]] attack the night prior.<ref name="Chapter 7" />

